OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FMark Forrest introduces an
OL,12,     Fafternoon of specially made
OL,13,     Frecordings, including highlights
OL,14,     Ffrom summer festivals in
OL,15,     FAmsterdam, Utrecht and Edinburgh.
OL,16,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,17,     FLive from Ely Cathedral, with
OL,18,     Fmusic to mark the 100th
OL,19,     Fanniversary of the birth of
OL,20,     Forganist and composer Arthur
OL,21,     FWills, Director of Music at Ely
OL,22,     FCathedral from 1958 to 1990.
